<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AFTI Portal</title>
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<style>
:root { 
    --bg: #0f172a; 
    --card: #1e293b; 
    --txt: #f8fafc; 
    --sage-light: #D0D9CD; 
    --sage-botanical: #9CAF88; 
    --sage-earth: #6b705c;
    --accent: #38bdf8; 
    --muted: #94a3b8; 
}
body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--txt); margin: 0; padding: 0; }
nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 1.25rem 2rem; background: var(--card); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(156, 175, 136, 0.2); }
nav a { color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; font-size: 0.95rem; }
nav a:hover { color: var(--sage-botanical); }
main { max-width: 900px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
.block { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid rgba(156, 175, 136, 0.25); border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.img-box { border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(156, 175, 136, 0.3); margin: 1.5rem 0; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
.btn { display: block; text-align: center; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; background: var(--sage-botanical); padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s; }
.btn:hover { background: var(--sage-earth); transform: translateY(-2px); }
.btn-action { background: rgba(156, 175, 136, 0.15); color: var(--sage-botanical); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid rgba(156, 175, 136, 0.3); }
.btn-action:hover { background: rgba(156, 175, 136, 0.3); color: #fff; }
.narrative-callout { background: rgba(156, 175, 136, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(156, 175, 136, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 25px; margin: 2rem 0; line-height: 1.7; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- STREAMLINED SITE NAVIGATION BAR -->
<nav>
    <div style="font-weight:900; font-size:1.25rem; color:#fff;">AFTI Portal</div>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:1.25rem; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="training-modules-and-mutual-growth.html">Training &amp; Certification</a>
        <a href="partners.html">Partners</a>
        <a href="shared-harvest.html">Shared Harvest</a>
        <a href="participant-matching-system.html" class="btn-action">System Architecture &amp; Portfolio Building &rarr;</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<main>
<div class="block">
    <!-- OUTGROWING-AG CENTERED AT TOP -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.0rem;">
        <span style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:900; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.25em; color:var(--sage-botanical);">Outgrowing-Ag</span>
    </div>

    <!-- WILLAMETTE VALLEY INITIATIVE BOX CENTERED BELOW TEXT -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <span style="background:rgba(156,175,136,0.15); color:var(--sage-botanical); font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.1em; padding:0.4rem 1rem; border-radius:20px; border:1px solid rgba(156,175,136,0.3); display:inline-block;">Willamette Valley Initiative</span>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.7; color:#cbd5e1; margin:0 0 1.3rem 0;">The Agricultural Future &amp; Training Initiative (AFTI) bridges the gap between under-utilized land and next-generation growers. We combine rigorous vocational pathways, custom advisory SOP alignment, and cooperative land-linking frameworks to deploy elite field teams that ensure mutual economic revitalization and regional food security across Linn County.</p>

    <!-- ORIGINAL FIELD PHOTO PRESERVED -->
    <div class="img-box">
        <img src="PXL_20250730_184302226.jpg" alt="Field Operations" style="width:100%; height:300px; object-fit:cover; display:block;">
        <div style="position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; background:linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(15,23,42,0.95)); padding:1.2rem;">
            <span style="color:var(--sage-botanical); font-weight:900; font-size:1.0rem; text-transform:uppercase;">Linn County Field Operations</span>
            <p style="color:#cbd5e1; margin:0.2rem 0 0 0; font-size:1.0rem;">Restoring under-productive land assets into high-yield community infrastructure.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
